{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"プルルルル\nただいま留守にしております\n留守番電話にメッセージをお願いいたします\n「こんばんは、もしもし、日奈子で」ピー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ということで！22回目のファンの方が\n考えてくださった今日の冒頭あいさつは\nトレイ・ヒューバーさんから頂きました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この冒頭挨拶面白いよね！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪伸びた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年も残り2日間！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年を振り返るブログが\n追いつきません。助けてください。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もお仕事がんばるぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから、明日で今年の燃えるゴミ終わりだから、お部屋を片付けてこなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やばい！やることいっぱい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年中に全部終わらせて\nスッキリして2016年迎えるぞ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年1日にいく初詣\n今年も家族みんなで行けそうで\n嬉しいし幸せです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"毎年初詣にいく神社があるんだけど\n可愛いあの動物もいるから楽しみ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"朝方にいつも神社に着くから\n寒くないようにたくさん着込むんだけど\n去年はベイマックスが流行ってて\n家族みんなでお互いをベイマックスって言って\n笑ってたの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は日奈子ね、\n着込むのすごい得意なんだ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"シュール"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりのー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヒナコセレクト(仮)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆えーせいさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁妄想クリスマスのときの髪型は外ハネニット？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎あの時の髪型はミックス巻きだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆トマトプリンさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ワイルドきいちゃんだぜぇ\nきいちゃんこの前フライパンを曲げてやったぜぇ\n1回も使ってないのにだぜぇ\nワイルドだろう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎はっっっ！！！確かによく考えたら\n日奈子、スギちゃんさん並みにワイルドだ！！！！すごい！今気づいた！確かに一回も使ってないフライパン曲げたことある！！！すごい！日奈子ワイルド！ワイルドだぜぇ～～～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆棚からよもぎ餅さん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんがチップに似てるんですか？\nそれとも、チップがきいちゃんに似てるんですか？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎きいちゃんもチップに似ていて\nチップもきいちゃんに似てるんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆マッキーノさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ALL MV COLLECTION買ったよ！\nそこで質問！きいちゃんがやってみたい\nMVはありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎THEアイドルソングをTHEアイドルの衣装とメイクでTHEアイドルのMV！！っていうMVがいい！！！それも、ダンスシーンとドラマシーンがはいってるやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆受験生のほりさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁来年もいいスタートでいくぞー イースター島 それっ 日奈子のブログ始まるよ でどうでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎おおお！いいね！すごい！冒頭あいさつじゃなくてヒナコセレクト(仮)で使っちゃった！！！笑\n一発ギャグとか持ちたいな！この間、川後さんの一発ギャグみたの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ルタオさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁もうすぐ紅白だけど、緊張してますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎緊張してきました！！！\n緊張してきましたが、お名前が\nあのチーズケーキのフロマージュのお店の\nお名前と同じで美味しそうです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっと休憩！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がおー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆うえむーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁ヒナコはキタノの歌詞で\n「君への○○ 遠すぎて\n涙でアイスが塩味になった」\nこの○○の部分の歌詞が聞き取れません！\n何て言っているのか教えてください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎「君への ロングシュート 遠すぎて\n涙でアイスが塩味になった」です！\n学生時代バスケ部だったから、\nバスケのロングシュートとかけたんだよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆けんけんぱさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁きいちゃんに握手会で友達感覚で会えるようになる！ってのが2016年の目標です！！\nきいちゃんは仕事以外で2016年にこれはやりたいって目標ありますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いいねいいね！\n仕事以外かー！何だろう！たくさんあるから、時間ある時にまとめてみるね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆待ち受けチップさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁今日のブログも、どんどんいくどん!、ひなこどん!!、う～～な丼!!!!!\n北野日名子です。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎北野日奈子です。。。\n私もホームの方の待ち受けチップ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆きのこさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁お正月はどうすごすかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎皆さんが想像つかないくらい\nダラダラして過ごしてやるっ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆りゅうとさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁年下やけど敬語使うべきか悩んでるんよね..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎全然気にせず普通に話してください♪\n私も皆さんに対して普通に話すときと敬語で話す時と使い分けてるから！！！\nあんまり意識してないよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ごんたさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁「お...俺だって、す、す、好」ぷぅー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎いやいや！！！笑\nぷぅーじゃないから！！！笑\nピーだから！！！好....ピー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆ちゃっきーさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁日奈子前髪短いほうがかわいいよ絶対！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎日奈子、前髪短いときあったっけ？\nいつごろー？(｡・・｡)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◆福くんさん◆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"◁どうしても眠い場合はどうしてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"▶︎目を開けたまま脳を眠らせます。未央奈が昔やってたんだけど、最近その技つかえるようになったの！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はこれで終わりです！！！\n久しぶりだったから、少し多めにセレクトしてみたよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんお誕生日おめでとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんいつも\nアンダラ後にメールを下さるんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここがよかった！\nあそこがよかった！\n成長したね！きんちゃん！\nって(╥ω╥`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんだいすきです！\n生駒さんは目がすごく綺麗！\nピカピカに輝いてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒さんからの攻撃やいたずら\n最近受けてないから\n受けたいな～(｡・・｡)なんてねっ♪笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2015/12/29/0098178/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ファンの方が考えてくださった\nブログ締めのあいさつ\n15回目はサンクエトリストさんからです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"例え、速度制限かかっても...私は突き進みます！"}],"source":"archive"}